{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：扫读速度不如X，尤其S01、S05等短停留段落，感受句较密，普通观众可能来不及看完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然文字更多，但重点短语加亮、话与感受交替、部分感受随音乐到时出现，让观众更容易抓住叙事关键，也能感受到人物每一步情绪变化的原因。它的水波、船、呼吸、光线等意象不是简单堆砌，而是随着心动、克制、暴露、恐惧、接纳不断变化，使整首曲子的情绪发展更连贯，感受也明显比X具体细腻。X的短词更方便快速扫视，但不少词停留在情绪标签或零散印象，观众需要自己补足它们之间的关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e75483d-ef59-41c9-8be5-f00c2937157e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T065306327780Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:53:48.645376+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "062b77933cb31ce1b7cd0ae7cda6815192551d241c91214f6a815354b915c092", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach